{"metadata":{"title":"TrackingPlanTesting","externalID":"TrackingPlanTesting","roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"TrackingPlanTesting"}],"role":"collection","symbolKind":"module"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The tracking plan is how the people and services that read an app’s events learn what each event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holds, so it is only useful while it matches the events. With this test, a change to an event"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t pass the app’s tests until the plan is exported again, and reviewers see the change as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"JSON diff of the plan. The test’s report also says which changes would break payloads from released"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app versions or records already stored."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting\/expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)"},{"type":"text","text":" checks a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlan"},{"type":"text","text":" against the plan"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"committed in a directory, as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlan.check(againstDirectory:)"},{"type":"text","text":" does. When they differ, it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"records a Swift Testing issue whose comment is the check’s report, the same text the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"command prints, and it returns the check either way. A plan that is only out of date fails the test"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a breaking one does: in both cases the committed plan isn’t what exporting the events writes."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the product to an app’s test target, so the check runs wherever the app’s tests do. It imports"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Swift Testing, so it belongs in test targets only. To run the check from the command line or CI"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without a test, use the app’s own "},{"code":"TrackingPlanCommand","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" executable from "},{"code":"TrackingPlans","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import Testing","import TrackingPlanTesting","","@Test func eventsMatchTheTrackingPlan() throws {","    let directory = URL(fileURLWithPath: #filePath)","        .deletingLastPathComponent()","        .appendingPathComponent(\"TrackingPlan\")","    expectTrackingPlan(try AppTrackingPlan.trackingPlan, matches: directory)","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The guide ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"covers exporting the plan this test checks.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplantesting"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fail a Swift Testing test when an app’s events no longer match its committed tracking plan, so every change to an event comes with a change to the plan."}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Checking from a test","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting\/expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)"],"anchor":"Checking-from-a-test"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://TrackingPlanTesting/documentation/TrackingPlanTesting":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Fail a Swift Testing test when an app’s events no longer match its committed tracking plan, so every change to an event comes with a change to the plan."}],"title":"TrackingPlanTesting","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplantesting","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://TrackingPlanTesting/documentation/TrackingPlanTesting/expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlanTesting\/documentation\/TrackingPlanTesting\/expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)","title":"expectTrackingPlan(_:matches:sourceLocation:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"expectTrackingPlan","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A4PlanV","text":"TrackingPlan","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"matches","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials3URLV","text":"URL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sourceLocation","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Testing14SourceLocationV","text":"SourceLocation","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13TrackingPlans0A9PlanCheckO","text":"TrackingPlanCheck","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackingplantesting\/expecttrackingplan(_:matches:sourcelocation:)","abstract":[{"text":"Records a Swift Testing issue when ","type":"text"},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" no longer matches the plan committed in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"directory","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", its comment the check’s report, as the ","type":"text"},{"code":"check","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" command prints it.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/trackingplanworkflow":{"title":"Exporting and Checking a Tracking Plan","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Exporting and Checking a Tracking Plan","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow","type":"link"}}}